From [[Cradle to Cradle]].

A [[Biological Nutrient]] and a [[Technical Nutrient]] stuck together so they can't be pulled apart. Paperboard coated in plastic film. Foil layered with plastic.

The paper can't rot and the plastic can't be recycled. Both are lost.
